#: ../../source/usage.rst:2 33c9e7ca8f124032b5a98c8cac4cf66c
msgid "_`Usage and verification`"
msgstr "_`用法与验证`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:4 ee5ca7616b474af18d22ca59ae92131a
msgid "This page is the part a user actually needs: the three faces of the library, the model behind them, and the evidence that they work."
msgstr "本页是使用者真正需要的部分：库的三个使用面、它们背后的模型，以及它们确实可用的证据。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:8 ec36e7d59c4a4b68a9dd732099b957a0
msgid "_`C++ path (recommended for board-level work)`"
msgstr "_`C++ 路径（上板首选）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:10 c69780bb6cbb4f78a72a0cfe953adb7d
msgid "Every policy is a template parameter: the observer, the modulator, the controllers and the HAL. Nothing is virtual, and swapping a policy costs nothing at run time."
msgstr "所有策略都是模板参数：观测器、调制器、控制器与 HAL。没有虚函数，换策略不付运行时代价。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:13 d6f384ce69064f0181732248c476c7a2
msgid "one motor, one control step"
msgstr "一个电机，一个控制步"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:42 f6adcc0f5bb9441eb5051a4a8c6a491e
msgid ":code:`tick()` is noexcept, allocates nothing and does no I/O — it is the ISR entry point. The tuning helpers (:code:`current_pi_config`, :code:`speed_pi_config`) live in the library so the C path and the SIL bench use exactly the same numbers."
msgstr ":code:`tick()` 是 noexcept、不分配、不做 I/O——它就是 ISR 入口。整定辅助函数（:code:`current_pi_config`、:code:`speed_pi_config`）放在库里，保证 C 路径与 SIL 台架用的是同一组数。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:47 e27a2f3015eb4636a67a198044a82c3d
msgid "_`C path (non-C++ projects, glue code)`"
msgstr "_`C 路径（非 C++ 工程、胶水层）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:49 f81561b42b594ce5be7a003390f45eb6
msgid "the same motor through the frozen ABI"
msgstr "同一个电机，走冻结的 ABI"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:68 684d915c8c8d498c89b1f9348d81f9ce
msgid "Handles are opaque tokens carrying a generation counter: after :code:`foc_motor_destroy()` an old handle answers :code:`FOC_ERR_PARAM` instead of touching freed memory. The C path runs on the stub HAL with library defaults (20 kHz, 500 ns dead time, 5 A limit, 24 V bus); for real hardware use the C++ path."
msgstr "句柄是带代际计数的不透明令牌：调用 :code:`foc_motor_destroy()` 之后，旧句柄返回 :code:`FOC_ERR_PARAM`，而不是去碰已释放的内存。C 路径跑在桩 HAL 与库内默认值上（20 kHz、500 ns 死区、5 A 限流、24 V 母线）；上真实硬件请走 C++ 路径。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:74 46ea2024720a4c82bfd90f6eeb2e2133
msgid "_`Python path (host-side scripts)`"
msgstr "_`Python 路径（上位机脚本）`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:76 8f9a1fd63c4f4635bd4e2d53579a61f4
msgid "the same motor from Python"
msgstr "同一个电机，从 Python 驱动"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:89 79b09ee4716c458f85fae9b5b303d01e
msgid "The module binds the **C API**. Failures raise :code:`foc_python.FocError` whose :code:`code` attribute is the very :code:`ErrorCode` the C function returned — Python gets exceptions, you keep the raw code."
msgstr "模块绑定的是 **C API**。失败抛 :code:`foc_python.FocError`，其 :code:`code` 属性就是 C 函数返回的那个 :code:`ErrorCode`——Python 拿到异常，你仍保留原始错误码。"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:94 22e2b2cd60ac48838981763c1f260168
msgid "_`The model behind the loop`"
msgstr "_`控制环背后的模型`"

#: ../../source/usage.rst:96 96136e187fef47fba929172ddd4cbf4a
msgid "The controller sees a dq-frame PMSM. The plant used by the SIL tests integrates exactly this, with fixed-step RK4 at 10 µs against a 100 µs control step:"
msgstr "控制器看到的是 dq 轴 PMSM。SIL 测试用的 plant 就按下面这组方程积分：固定步长 RK4，10 µs 积分步长对 100 µs 控制步长："

#: ../../source/usage.rst:99 ac77b07afd91496d95d3792ba1f7008d
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\frac{di_d}{dt} &= \\frac{v_d - R_s i_d + \\omega_e L_q i_q}{L_d} \\\\\n"
"\\frac{di_q}{dt} &= \\frac{v_q - R_s i_q - \\omega_e L_d i_d - \\omega_e "
"\\psi_f}{L_q} \\\\\n"
"\\frac{d\\omega_m}{dt} &= \\frac{T_e - B \\omega_m - T_{load}}{J}, "
"\\qquad\n"
"T_e = \\tfrac{3}{2} p \\left(\\psi_f i_q + (L_d - L_q) i_d i_q\\right)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/usage.rst:109 cdaa72329c4348b5a3589088f1578872
msgid "with :math:`\\psi_f = K_t / (1.5 p)` and :math:`\\omega_e = p\\,\\omega_m`. The torque constant is *knot* the back-EMF constant: conflating them is the classic way to be wrong by 1.5 p."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\psi_f = K_t / (1.5 p)`、:math:`\\omega_e = p\\,\\omega_m`。转矩常数**不是**反电动势常数：把两者混为一谈，正是差 1.5 p 的经典错法。"

