#: ../../source/usage.rst:140 9343639e74f44ec2b0d7b080a3b96488
msgid "The SIL bench is layered on purpose: an analytic reference (L1), an independent offline arbiter (L2), and scenario tests S1–S5 (current step, speed step, sine tracking, saturation limit, parameter perturbation). The SguanFOC project is a *third* reference, not the judge."
msgstr "SIL 台架是分层设计的：解析解参考（L1）、独立的离线仲裁器（L2）、以及场景测试 S1–S5（电流阶跃、速度阶跃、正弦跟踪、饱和限幅、参数摄动）。SguanFOC 只是**第三**参考，不是裁判。"
